    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14719" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀραχν-αῖος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰρ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a
